OL,3,AValve's Steam Frame is excellent - but
OL,4,Aat over #1,000 is VR still too
OL,5,Aexpensive?
OL,6,
OL,7,FValve's new virtual reality headset,
OL,8,Fthe Steam Frame, has officially been
OL,9,Freleased - but it comes at a high
OL,10,Fprice.
OL,12,FThe hardware is excellent - a light
OL,13,Fdevice which feels comfortable to wear
OL,14,Fand is packed with clever technology -
OL,15,Fso long as you're willing to pay a
OL,16,Fwhopping #1,089 for a headset with 1TB
OL,17,Fof storage.
OL,19,FThe variant with 256GB of storage,
OL,20,Fmeanwhile, costs #889.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/17
