OL,3,AEmmys 2026: The winners and nominees in
OL,4,Afull
OL,5,
OL,6,FWidow's Bay, The Pitt and DTF St Louis
OL,7,Fwere among the big winners at the Emmy
OL,8,FAwards, which took place on Monday in
OL,9,FLos Angeles.
OL,11,FMany of this year's trophies were
OL,12,Fhanded out at the Creative Arts Emmys
OL,13,Fearlier this month, leaving only the
OL,14,Fmost high-profile categories for the
OL,15,Fmain ceremony.
